#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, leShortcut)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, leShortcut)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, lbShortcut)
#. +> trunk stable
#: searchproviderdlg_ui.ui:82 searchproviderdlg_ui.ui:87
#: searchproviderdlg_ui.ui:99
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"The shortcuts entered here can be used as a pseudo-URI scheme in KDE. For example, the shortcut <b>av</b> can be used as in <b>av</b>:<b>my search</b>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"De hier angeven Afkörten laat sik in KDE jüst so as Adressen bruken, a.B. kunnst Du <b>av</b> so bruken: <b>av</b>:<b>Mien Söökwoort</b>.\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbShortcut)
